  "description": "CR 700.4, 603.6c, 603.10a, 122.1a: whenever another creature or artifact its controller controls dies, Judge Magister Gabranth gets a +1/+1 counter; an opponent's creature, an enchantment, an exiled creature or Gabranth itself does not count",
